
Quota OS microkernel
Version: 016 (4c2a559)
基于三级资源声明的微内核，
保证一级任务永远不卡顿、二级任务运行不卡顿，三级任务则不保证。
[boot] EL1h, MMU off. No hardware isolation.
[boot] x0=0x42000000 physical RAM span 64 MB (probed)
[boot] DTB at 0x42000000
[boot] DTB snapshot 7512 bytes (header said 1048576)
[boot] DTB memory 67108864 bytes
[boot] system reserve 350 us/period, 16384 KB;
       tier-1 1500 us/period, 13312 KB; guard 80 us/period
[boot] cache colors: 32 (model: 2 MB 16-way cache, 4 KB pages);
       tier-1 pages in 11 own colors, padding 3584 KB
[boot] kernel image+bss 629 KB of the 16384 KB system reserve
[boot] GICv2 from DTB: distributor 0x8000000, cpu interface 0x8010000
[boot] CNTFRQ 62500000 Hz (1 tick = 16 ns), virtual timer PPI 27
[boot] clock: host time (not icount; timings are reference only)
[boot] simulated device IRQ line: EL1 physical timer, PPI 30
[boot] tier-1 display-vsync and timer-server bound to their slots
[boot] slot table from tick 1250000, period 625000 ticks, guard 1250 ticks
[boot] shell task running
[dev] 3 new simulated devices start in Tier 3; verifying
      (8 jobs, 8 aborts each, IRQs masked, before the next guard)
[dev] sim-dma: job 396/400 us, stop 16/20 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[dev] sim-blk: job 1991/2000 us, stop 1770/2000 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[dev] sim-cam: job 291/300 us, stop 8/30 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]

命令（输入数字后回车）:
  1  资源总览：系统预留、Tier 1 槽和浪费、Tier 2、Tier 3
  2  安装应用：允许/拒绝（也可以停止应用）
  3  资源不够：拒绝并说明先关哪个应用
  4  旧设备：超过整机容量的请求被拒绝
  5  Tier 1 准时：抖动和错过都是 0
  6  Tier 1 超时在槽尾被掐断
  7  Tier 1 槽从不外借
  8  Tier 2 最低值有保证，建议值在压力下收回
  9  Tier 3 过载不影响上层
  10 任何一级的失控任务只拖慢自己
  11 设备申请 Tier 1：不能打断的设备被拒（说明缺哪一条）
  12 超额申请被拒（说明是哪种资源）
  13 预算令牌：驱动替谁干活就扣谁的预算
  14 设备超时：强制中止，设备降到 Tier 3（少报耗时的设备）
  15 中断风暴：多出来的中断被限流并计数
  16 带宽限流：超额就停到下个周期，不欠账
  17 缓存着色：每个 Tier 1 任务独占自己的缓存颜色
  18 IPC 余量：用过余量的调用者本周期新调用扣到下个周期
  h  帮助    q  提示如何退出 QEMU
select> 1

=== 1 资源总览 / resource overview ===
RAM 65536 KB. CPU period 10000 us. 1 tick = 16 ns.

[Devices] simulated (software models)
  sim-dma: verified
  sim-blk: verified
  sim-cam: verified

[系统预留] kernel, fixed, never lent
  CPU 350 us/period = 21875 ticks
  measured since boot: max 98184 ticks/period (period 0 of 8)
  that period ran menu 0; kernel ticks by entry (count):
    timer IRQ 92037 (10), slot guard wait 0 (0),
    device IRQ 0 (0), svc IPC/dev 0 (0), svc other 6147 (2);
    of which period-boundary work 0, waits for a deadline 0
    reserve 21875, margin -76309
  memory 16384 KB

[Tier 1] one fixed slot per task; unused time stays idle
  task           slot offset_us len_us max_used_us waste_us mem_kb
  display-vsync     0      1000    500          84      416   2048
  timer-server      1      3500    300          57      243   1024
  gic-server        2      6000    300           0      300   2048
  blk-driver        3      8000    400           0      400   4096
  net-driver        -         -      -           -        -   4096
  total CPU 1500 us/period, memory 13312 KB

[Tier 2] admitted apps (minimum is guaranteed, suggested is spare only)
  (none)
  minimum sum: CPU 0 / 8070 us, memory 0 / 32256 KB
  admission: reserve 350 + tier-1 1500 + tier-2 min 0
    + guard 80 = 1930 <= 10000 us

[Tier 3] everyone else, round robin 1000 us, leftover only
  CPU not promised to anyone: 8070 us/period
pressure: off
